<title>Our Playlist ❤️</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Georgia,serif;
}

body{

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe4f3,#efe2ff,#ffffff);

padding:25px;

min-height:100vh;

}

h1{

text-align:center;

color:#d81b60;

font-size:38px;

margin-bottom:10px;

}

.subtitle{

text-align:center;

